Subject: Separate legacy tweak diagnostics from original native source

Upstream-base: a8187061af65aa2022bfd8dc2e32163089ea0090

The historical registration wrapper, parsing guards and game-side fixes
require MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_TWEAKS. Original native TUs retain retail
initialization flags, state push/reset, pending order, parsing and ownership
decisions. Native pool layouts, typed binding addresses and allocation
signatures remain ABI adaptations. Extracted value methods are diagnostics
only; production requires their whole original Game/AIPad providers.

